ontrol in soldier mode, or unlocking abilities that can only be used in commander mode. How you choose to fight - and how you choose to Protect Pine Valley - is entirely up to you.</p>","developers":["BoomTown Snipes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189670/649a0aca2ef1f3c2acd281aaa6f61bd0e896340e/header.jpg?t=1763050226","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3189670/787874185/2be7d53fd1fd768ac62e1ab7c767a743d4d99c6a/1762561756/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762562779","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3189670/787874185/2be7d53fd1fd768ac62e1ab7c767a743d4d99c6a/1762561756/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762562779","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3189670/787874185/2be7d53fd1fd768ac62e1ab7c767a743d4d99c6a/1762561756/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762562779","id":257227399,"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227399/862b1694e76a95ec29b14f07e2137b6f70a1b15d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762562779"}],"name":"Protect Pine Valley","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core(TM) i7<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["BoomTown Snipes"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nConte\u00fado sexual","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewa